      "message": "Though as soon as the charger is unplugged, UI will drop down to the actual level of charge.  That is:\n\n- Plug in charger; charging takes place\n- Charger says it\u0027s done, but battery only says 95%\n- This code overrides that to 99%\n- Unplug charger; battery level in UI drops immediately to 95%\n\nNot too bad if state_of_charge is close to 99%.  Could this ever happen for some reason when it\u0027s significantly below that?  (e.g. charging stopped due to high temperature)",
